Why a Hybrid Profile? 
Most products fail at the design-engineering handoff. I close that gap — I design with developers in mind, and I code 
with users in mind. One brain, two skill sets, fewer translation losses. 
UI/UX DESIGN EXPERTISE 
Design Process 
• Discovery & Research: Stakeholder interviews, competitive analysis, user interviews, contextual inquiry 
• Define: Personas, empathy maps, user journey maps, jobs-to-be-done framework 
• Design: Information architecture, user flows, wireframes (low-fi → high-fi), interactive prototypes 
• Validate: Usability testing, heuristic evaluation, accessibility audits, design iteration 
Design Systems & Visual Craft 
• Foundations: Color systems (semantic tokens), typography scales, spacing systems (4pt/8pt grid) 
• Components: Atomic design methodology, reusable Figma libraries with auto-layout & variants 
• Accessibility: WCAG 2.1 AA compliance, keyboard nav, screen reader support, RTL (Arabic) 
UI/UX Tools 
• Figma (advanced — auto-layout, components, variants, prototyping, Dev Mode), Adobe XD, Photoshop, 
Illustrator, FigJam, Miro 
